+// rustcc Phase 2 (B.2): item-tree representation for a `class`.
+// Field shape is implicitly Record (curly-brace member list) so we
+// don't store it. v0 has no inheritance/virtuality state here —
+// those land via B.4's class-specific signature/flag work.
